  "typeCharacter": "Bitter is a sturdy slab serif, like carved balcony boards: used in heavy weight, sentence case, very large in the hero (about 7vw, tight leading), 48 to 64 px for section headings. Karla carries running text at 18 px in regular weight with generous leading, and small details in semibold, never uppercase-tracked.",
  "composition": "Hero: full height of the first screen, split. Columns 1 to 5 are a deep spruce field (#18261e) holding the h1 in Bitter heavy in #eef3ef, stacked on three lines, the lead in Karla below it on 4 columns, and one square-cornered geranium-red button. Columns 6 to 12 are the house photo bled to the top and right edges, cropped to the balcony of geraniums and the peaks above. Under the hero, a full-width ribbon about 44 px tall of red and off-light gingham check (drawn pattern, no text). Rooms section on the light ground: bedroom photo in a tall portrait on columns 1 to 5 with its two top corners cut; columns 7 to 12 hold a large Bitter numeral 4 in red beside the heading, the text, and a compact list: soba, apartma za 4 osebe, nočitev z zajtrkom, polpenzion, otroci do 6 let brezplačno. Breakfast section: full-width geranium-red band (#b0302a); breakfast photo bleeds from the left edge across columns 1 to 6; columns 8 to 12 carry the story heading and text in #f6f4f2, plus a short line about the children feeding goats and rabbits. Weekend lunches: light ground, heading on columns 1 to 6, a week strip across columns 1 to 12 with seven equal cells, Saturday and Sunday filled red with 11.00–19.00 in light text, other days in a thin spruce outline; beneath, a Karla list of the lunch menu: juha, pečenka, štruklji, jabolčni zavitek, and a line that groups are welcome on weekdays by arrangement. Hiking: the cows-and-mountains photo as the full section ground under a flat spruce scrim at about 55 percent, heading in Bitter large on columns 1 to 7, a short list of Raduha, Logarska dolina and the small ski slope 10 minutes away. Team: light surface field (#e3ebe5), heading on columns 1 to 6, a small ink drawing of an alpine flower sprig on columns 9 to 11. Contact: deep spruce field, the phone as a large Bitter numeral on columns 1 to 7, email and address in Karla below, a simple schematic map in thin light lines on columns 8 to 12, one red button. Thin footer on the same field.",
  "imagery": "The four photos used as the house's own views: the house in the hero bled right, the bedroom tall with cut corners, the breakfast table bled left inside the red band, the cows on the pasture as a scrimmed section ground. Drawn art: one gingham ribbon pattern in #b0302a on #f6f4f2, painted flat as a textile strip; one fine spruce-green ink drawing of an alpine flower sprig (edelweiss and gentian leaves) on the plain #e3ebe5 ground, apart from text.",
  "signature": "The red-and-white gingham ribbon from the guest beds running full width under the hero, echoed by the red breakfast band and the two red weekend days in the week strip.",
  "copy": {
    "headline": "Razgled na gore iz vsake sobe",
    "lead": "4 sobe in apartma pod Raduho, zajtrk iz pridelkov naše kmetije in kruh iz krušne peči. Planinske poti se začnejo kar pri hiši."
  },
  "imagePrompt": "A single flat full-page screenshot of a desktop homepage, 1536×1024 px, no browser window, no device frame, no perspective. A Slovene mountain tourist farm website. Page ground very light cool green-white #f1f5f2, text dark spruce #1c2a22, muted #4d5e53, one strong colour geranium red #b0302a, deep spruce #18261e for dark fields, light text #eef3ef on dark. Headings in Bitter, heavy slab serif, sentence case; body in Karla regular. No gradients, no shadows, no pill buttons, square-cornered buttons only. Section 1, hero: left 5 of 12 columns a deep spruce #18261e field with a very large three-line Bitter heavy headline in #eef3ef, a short Karla lead below, one square red #b0302a button with light text. Right 7 columns: the attached photo of the wooden farmhouse with the red geranium balcony and mountain peaks, bled to the top and right edges. Directly below the hero, a full-width thin ribbon of red #b0302a and light #f6f4f2 gingham check pattern, about 44 px tall, no text on it. Section 2 on the light ground: left, the attached bedroom photo with red gingham beds, tall portrait crop with both top corners cut diagonally; right side, a large red Bitter numeral 4 next to a heading, a paragraph and a short plain list separated by thin rules. Section 3: full-width geranium red #b0302a band; the attached breakfast photo (cheese, cottage cheese, jam, bread, milk) bleeds from the left edge across half the width; right side heading and text in #f6f4f2. Section 4 on the light ground: heading at left, then a full-width week strip of seven equal rectangular cells, the last two cells filled red with light text, the other five outlined in thin spruce lines; a short menu list below. Section 5: the attached photo of cows grazing on a mountain pasture as a full-width section ground under a flat dark spruce scrim, large light Bitter heading on the left and a short list. Section 6 on a pale green surface #e3ebe5: heading at left and on the right a small fine spruce-green ink drawing of an alpine flower sprig with edelweiss and gentian, on the plain ground, separated from all text. Section 7: deep spruce #18261e field, the phone number as a large Bitter numeral in #eef3ef on the left with email and address below in Karla, a simple schematic map of thin light lines on the right, one square red button. A thin footer on the same dark field. Asymmetric layout on a 12-column grid, nothing centred, no icons, no faces of people, no other photos than the four attached."
}

